 * duration_cast/floor/ceil/round, the clocks and the literals.
 * steady_clock / high_resolution_clock read lithosys_clock_now_ns(MONOTONIC);
 * system_clock reads REALTIME. A failed host read returns time zero rather
 * than garbage (fail safe; the host contract says it does not fail). */
